?” dark)Gamefeel and input improvements for a more comfortable investigationBug fixesA bunch of ne","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:18:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681047","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546740-1846018067933208","game_id":"steam-4546740","kind":"announcement","title":"INDOORS: Trespasser is out now!","summary":"INDOORS: Trespasser is out now!Break into the Alston Manor in the search of your dad in this short detective escape room!Even though the game is fully released, expect news on version 1.0 soon, adding some gameplay adjustments, controller support and a couple more secrets that hide in the manor.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T12:52:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933208","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4546740-1844115010495450","game_id":"steam-4546740","kind":"announcement","title":"INDOORS: Trespasser gets a release!","summary":"Trespasser Gets a Release DateThe final trailer for INDOORS: Trespasser is here, and with it, a release date: October 9.Trespasser puts you in the shoes of Duncan Smith, searching for his father Lucas, whose trail runs cold at the Alston Manor. As a standalone prologue, it comes with its own exclusive puzzles, its own suspects, and a zone you won't find in the main game: the Approach, the stretch of forest and overgrown grounds leading up to the manor's side porch, before you ever set foot insid","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-18T16:46:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/18441150104